# built with --no-compile-function-source a message spells what failed from the value and the name: a read only in an error whose trace has a frame, a call in every error
# the program of quoted-text.ir, with Error.stackTraceLimit = 0 and 1
# OPTIONS: exclude=FunctionSource
# RUN: run-in-shell Error.stackTraceLimit = 0; globalThis.report = message => print(message);
# CHECK: undefined is not an object
# CHECK-NEXT: task.run is not a function. (In 'task.run()', 'task.run' is undefined)
# CHECK-NEXT: null is not an object
# CHECK-NEXT: exited with 0
# RUN(ZERO): run-in-shell Error.stackTraceLimit = 0; globalThis.report = message => print(message);
# ZERO-NOT: evaluating
# RUN(ONE): run-in-shell Error.stackTraceLimit = 1; globalThis.report = message => print(message);
# ONE: undefined is not an object (evaluating 'undefined.title')
# ONE-NEXT: task.run is not a function. (In 'task.run()', 'task.run' is undefined)
# ONE-NEXT: null is not an object (evaluating 'null.run')
# ONE-NEXT: exited with 0
# PROGRAM-OF: quoted-text.ir
